{"about_the_game":"&quot;...there are things I couldn't say, but there's so much I wish you had known. There are things I never meant but said, being rude, speaking in arrogant tone. But, time made me realize that black and white isn't always wise, and that sometimes, things can be grey...&quot;<br><br>'<strong>Dear Mom</strong>' is a short narrative-adventure game, an emotional narrative about a child\u2019s feelings written to her mom, a letter which, always, will remain unread.<br><br>Key Feature: -<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A poetic narration of a letter, written to mom.<br></li><li> Focuses more on experience rather than actions and puzzles.<br></li><li> A 15-30 minutes immersive emotional experience.<br></li><li> An unforgettable lifetime experience.</li></ul><br>Voice Credit - Veronica Laux (@RonixVa)\u200b","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Unread Letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/2d7b5cb5e6ec074d4ed55caa4f9e85a572e3ca58.jpg"},{"name":"Mom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/9de9ad92924d713a3f969d2e552cde930763e06d.jpg"},{"name":"Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/3de5c5615277d4260948d8c159f78ce328e6005f.jpg"},{"name":"PRESENCE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/214653c0c5e604535eb2357753a4e3c7a8233ed1.jpg"},{"name":"Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/1ada610166e88073fdd55ea406bdbd7c6c2be3c0.jpg"},{"name":"Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/ea2f6d6f172c4fefb88c21857128971050bd51b2.jpg"},{"name":"Childhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1518140/dbbad0131a58d1c1b0c8669deb1ef4c41a475104.jpg"},{"name":"Adulthood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image